flowchart LR
    U[User / React UI] -->|HTTP| API[FastAPI API]
    API --> DB[(PostgreSQL + pgvector)]
    API --> Q[Redis queue]
    Q --> W[Celery worker]
    W --> R[Document router]
    R --> PDF[PDF text layer / OCR]
    R --> IMG[Image OCR]
    R --> XLS[Excel / CSV parser]
    PDF --> E[Structured extraction]
    IMG --> E
    XLS --> E
    E --> V[Evidence verification]
    V --> F[Financial validation]
    F --> DB
    DB --> S[Keyword search / pgvector semantic search]
    S --> API
    E -.-> L[OpenAI structured output]
    S -.-> EMB[OpenAI embeddings]
